Third-party assets

muse bundles no typeface.

**Icon artwork is bundled** in `src/lib/icons-data.ts` — the paths for the 53 names in
`src/lib/icons.ts`, frozen into the package so nothing is fetched from api.iconify.design at
runtime. The collection permits redistribution and requires the notice below:

- **Iconoir** by Luca Burgio — MIT (MIT), strokes rewritten to width 2
  https://github.com/iconoir-icons/iconoir/blob/main/LICENSE

`scripts/build-icons.ts` refuses to bundle a collection whose licence metadata it cannot read,
and `icon-data.test.ts` fails the build if a bundled collection is not credited here.

If a typeface is reintroduced, record its licence here before the files are committed, and
keep `src/lib/styles/fonts.test.ts` passing — muse is distributed to every Facile app, so a
font added to this repo is a font redistributed thirteen times over.
